  "reflectionText": "James said: count it all joy when you fall into various trials, because the testing of your faith produces endurance. Let endurance have its perfect work, that you may be lacking in nothing. How do you count it joy when the testing has not yet finished, and you cannot yet see what the endurance is making in you?"
